{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bPlease note that game content is subject to change without notice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Dark Rom-Com with Monster Maids!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408340/extras/f61a0d1827f463446cae7847d50f87a7.avif?t=1773334814\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408340/extras_big/f61a0d1827f463446cae7847d50f87a7.avif?t=1773334814 width=800 height=227 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>\u25c6Feed and Raise, Rom-Com Style Roguelight</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've been reincarnated in the Demon World as a \u201cliving cake\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and have been given the power to make those you feed grow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408340/extras/2ddebbccad8d7139ab539a448f1fdcaa.avif?t=1773334814\" width=152 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>\u25c6Aim to Be the No.1 Maid Cafe in the Demon World!</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've hired at a maid cafe in the Demon World, and</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you repeat the process of feeding one of the maids once a day</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >to make them grow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>\u25c6Charming and Unique Monster Maids</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In return for  the top sales, you aim to become human again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The maids at your workplace are all problem children,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >from demons to lycaness to slimes, and they come from all sorts of different races.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>\u25c6and A Rom-Com with Monster Maids!</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even these maids have their own goals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you work together to achieve your sales targets, you may find yourself falling in love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The power of romance can contribute to sales too!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3408340?t=1773334814","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408340/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773334814","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408340/d8ecefc32bd924c6c5205189ddfd0c23b8b42e74/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773334814","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408340/d8ecefc32bd924c6c5205189ddfd0c23b8b42e74/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773334814","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bPlease note that game content is subject to change without notice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Dark Rom-Com with Monster Maids!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408340/extras/f61a0d1827f463446cae7847d50f87a7.avif?t=1773334814\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408340/extras_big/f61a0d1827f463446cae7847d50f87a7.avif?t=1773334814 width=800 height=227 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>\u25c6Feed and Raise, Rom-Com Style Roguelight</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've been reincarnated in the Demon World as a \u201cliving cake\u201